ent-FuWeaponSniperMosin = Kardashev-Mosin
    .desc = A true relic, the Kardashev-Mosin has served in nearly every armed conflict since its creation 670 years ago. The bolt-action design of the rifle remains virtually identical to its original design, whether used for hunting, sniping, or endless trench warfare. Loads 5 rounds of .30 rifle.
